=== task: code medium
title: A folder outline
prompt: Write `outline(folder, depth)` that returns a list of lines for the folder tree below `folder`, in preorder: first the folder's own line, its name indented by two spaces per level of `depth`, then the lines of each subfolder, at `depth + 1`. `make()` builds a folder tree to test with.

For example, `outline(make(), 0)` starts `['home', '  music', '    jazz', ...]`.
